<title>DUBAI: Saudi Aramco cuts A-960 bunker fuel price.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco cuts A-960 bunker fuel price.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco said on Wednesday it had cut A-960 bunker prices by $2 a tonne to $125 from Gulf ports and $129 from the Red Sea, from October 31.</p>
<p>A-888 bunker prices from all ports were unchanged at $225.</p>
<p>Aramco's move tracks weaker Gulf bunker markets.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255</p>
</text>
